    "desc_en": "I can't code. I can't draw. But I love games — and I spent way too much money on them. So I'm making my own Roblox game, Halo & Horns, with seven AI (Claude) teammates: one boss checks everything, two write the code, two draw the art (Adobe Firefly), one puts it in the game, and one made this video. I'm the director. Halloween beta: October 31! Not sponsored. AI voice narration.",
